{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":54,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ܠܪܝܫ ܓܘܕܐ ܕܙܡܪ̈ܐ. ܒܩܝܬܪ̈ܐ. ܡܲܣܟܝܼܠܔ ܕܕܘܝܕ، ܐܝܡܢ ܕܐܬ‌ܐ ܠܗܘܢ ܙܝܦܝ̈ܐ ܘܐܡܝܪܗܘܢ ܠܫܐܘܠܔ: ”ܗܐ، ܠܐ ܝܠܗ ܕܘܝܕ ܛܘܫܝܘܗ̇ ܓܢܗ ܠܟܣ ܠܢ؟“"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܝܵܐ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ، ܦܲܪܸܩ ܠܝܼ ܒܫܸܡܘܼܟ݂،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܥܒ݂ܘܿܕ ܕܝܼܘܵܢܝܼ ܒܓܲܒܵܪܘܼܬܘܼܟ݂.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܝܵܐ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ، ܫܡܹܥ ܠܵܗ̇ ܨܠܘܿܬ‌ܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗܲܒ݂ܠܔ ܢܵܬܵ‌ܐ ܠܗܹܡܸܙܡܵܢܹ̈ܐ ܕܦܘܼܡܝܼ،","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܗ̇ܝ ܕܢܘܼܟ݂ܪ̈ܵܝܹܐ ܩܝܼܡ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܥܲܠܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܛܵܠܝܼܡܹ̈ܐ ܛܥܹܐ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܠܓܵܢܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܠܵܐ ܡܘܼܬܸܒ݂ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ ܒܲܠܩܘܼܒ݂ܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ. ܣܹܠܵܗ","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗܵܐ، ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ ܗܲܝܸܪܵܢܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ ܐܸܠܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ ܣܵܢܕܵܢܵܐ ܕܓܵܢܝܼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܡܲܕܸܪ ܒܝܼܫܬܵ‌ܐ ܥܲܠܔ ܕܸܫ̃ܡܸܢܝܼ̈،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܫܲܪܝܼܪܘܼܬܘܼܟ݂ ܡܲܫܬܸܩ ܠܗܘܿܢ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܩܘܼܪܒܵܢܵܐ ܕܨܸܒ݂ܝܵܢܵܐ ܒܸܬ ܕܵܒ݂ܚܹܢ ܐܸܠܘܼܟ݂،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܫܲܟܪܸܢ ܠܫܸܡܘܼܟ݂، ܝܵܐ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ، ܒܗ̇ܝ ܕܛܵܒ݂ܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܗ̇ܝ ܕܡ̣ܢ ܟܠܔ ܥܵܘܩܵܢܵܐ ܩܵܡ ܦܲܨܹܐ ܠܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܚܙܹܐ ܠܵܗ̇ ܥܲܝܢܝܼ ܙܵܟ݂ܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ ܠܕܸܫ̃ܡܸܢܝܼ̈.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/54.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/55.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/53.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}